# Stray copies of edited files that editor tooling drops relative to whatever
# directory a shell happened to be in, e.g.
#   DemoServer/resources/vendor/Demos/StrangeObjectSegmenter/web/index.html
#   Demos/StrangeObjectSegmenter/bones/DemoServer/server.py
# They are always a nested "Demos/" or "DemoServer/", never the real ones at the
# repo root — the leading **/*/ requires at least one directory in front, so the
# top-level Demos/ and DemoServer/ are untouched.
**/*/Demos/
**/*/DemoServer/
